      "description": "U.S. Army Maj. Gen. Robert G. Catalanotti, left, the U.S. Central Command director of J7, exercise and training shakes hands with Kuwaiti army Maj. Gen. Abdulrazaq Al-Awadhi, the Kuwait Armed Forces assistant chief of staff for operations and plans with the Kuwait Ministry of Defense, after signing an agreement for Eagle Resolve, at a signing ceremony in Kuwait City, Kuwait, Oct. 31, 2013. Eagle Resolve is an annual multilateral exercise designed to enhance regional cooperative defense efforts of the Gulf Cooperation Council nations and U.S. Central Command. The exercise, hosted by Kuwait, is scheduled to occur during the first quarter of 2015, at the Kuwait Ministry of Defense, and will include sea, air and land components with the potential to involve up to 35 partner nations. (DoD photo by Sgt. Adam C. Keith, U.S. Army/Released)",
